lympics\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nav_special_olympics elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"nav_special_olympics\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/programs\/special-olympics\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Community Engagement<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-pg_content e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"pg_content\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ov_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Overview<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ov_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>At Good Shepherd Manor, home means safety and belonging, dignity and compassion. It means familiar routines, meaningful relationships, and knowing someone will notice when you are struggling and celebrate when you succeed.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ov_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We are honored to create that sense of home for the men we serve and grateful for the trust their families place in us.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ov_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1998\" height=\"1563\" src=\"https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-2260\" alt=\"Two men working on classroom activities in Community Day Services\" srcset=\"https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1.jpg 1998w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-300x235.jpg 300w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-1024x801.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-768x601.jpg 768w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-1536x1202.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1998px) 100vw, 1998px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_2_cap elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ov_2_cap\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><em>Placeholder photo \u2014 homes on the Momence campus.<\/em><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_personalized-support e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_personalized-support\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"personalized-support\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_personalized-support_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_personalized-support_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Personalized Support, Everyday Connection<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-personalized-support_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"personalized-support_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>All thirteen of Good Shepherd Manor\u2019s residential homes operate as Community Integrated Living Arrangements, or CILAs. This model emphasizes individualized support, personal choice, and community involvement while providing the assistance each man needs in daily life.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-personalized-support_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"personalized-support_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Each home offers a family-like atmosphere, with residents gathering for family-style breakfasts and dinners each day. With support suited to their abilities, the men help with cooking, cleaning, vacuuming, laundry, and other household responsibilities. These everyday activities build practical skills, encourage independence, and nurture pride in their shared home.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-personalized-support_2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"personalized-support_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Dedicated staff provide support around the clock, helping each man build independence, maintain relationships, and participate in activities he enjoys. Each person\u2019s needs, preferences, routines, and compatibility with housemates help guide a comfortable and welcoming home environment.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-personalized-support_3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"personalized-support_3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Shared meals, outings, celebrations, and opportunities for prayer bring people together. Whether enjoying a quiet evening with housemates or welcoming families for special events, these experiences strengthen the connections that make GSM home.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_leadership e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_leadership\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"leadership\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_leadership_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_leadership_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Present, Involved Leadership<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-leadership_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"leadership_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Quality care begins with listening and being present. Through Shepherd\u2019s Rounds, named in tribute to the Brothers who first stewarded this community, members of our senior leadership team visit homes each week to connect with the men and staff.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-leadership_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"leadership_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>These visits provide opportunities to hear concerns, recognize what is working well, and address challenges promptly. They strengthen relationships and keep leadership connected to everyday life in our homes.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_our-team e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_our-team\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"our-team\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_our-team_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_our-team_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Supporting the People Who Care<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-our-team_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"our-team_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The people who work in our homes are central to the quality of life the men experience. Staff training, including Safety Care, helps team members respond compassionately, de-escalate challenging situations, and support everyone\u2019s safety.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-our-team_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"our-team_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Developing leaders from within our team brings firsthand knowledge of residential life into supervisory roles. Clear documentation and communication tools, including the GSM Portal, help staff share information and provide consistent support across homes.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_comfort-safety e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_comfort-safety\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"comfort-safety\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_comfort-safety_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_comfort-safety_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Comfort, Safety, and Stability<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-comfort-safety_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"comfort-safety_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A dependable environment helps the men feel comfortable and confident in their daily lives. Maintaining heating, cooling, power, and lighting is an essential part of that commitment. Preventive maintenance and thoughtful upgrades help reduce unexpected disruptions and preserve familiar routines.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-comfort-safety_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"comfort-safety_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Improvements to boilers and heating and cooling equipment support comfort throughout the seasons. Whole-home generators, made possible through the generosity of families and donors, help residents remain in their homes during power outages. Planning for maintenance and eventual replacement helps preserve that reliability.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-comfort-safety_2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"comfort-safety_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Lighting along walkways, parking areas, and circle drives improves visibility after dark, supporting movement across campus and participation in activities.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_staying-connected e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_staying-connected\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"staying-connected\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_staying-connected_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_staying-connected_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Staying Connected<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-staying-connected_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"staying-connected_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>An upgraded communication system, radios, and campus technology help residential staff coordinate with nursing, supervisors, and support services during daily activities and emergencies. Maintaining these systems helps staff share information and respond when needs arise.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_history e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_history\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"history\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_history_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_history_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Growing with the Men We Serve<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-history_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"history_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Since our founding in 1971, Good Shepherd Manor has adapted to meet the changing needs of the men entrusted to our care. The Brothers and founding families helped establish a community that recognized the abilities, dignity, and humanity of people with intellectual and developmental disabilities.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-history_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"history_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In the 1990s, GSM began moving away from dormitory-style living into Intermediate Care Facility homes and later opened smaller CILA homes. These changes supported greater privacy, personal choice, and opportunities for connection.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_making-home-happen e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_making-home-happen\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"making-home-happen\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_making-home-happen_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_making-home-happen_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Making Home Happen<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-making-home-happen_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"making-home-happen_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Making home happen is the everyday work of Good Shepherd Manor. It is found in trusted relationships, shared laughter, thoughtful support, and quiet moments of kindness\u2014and in the attention that keeps each home running smoothly.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-making-home-happen_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"making-home-happen_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Dedicated staff, supportive families, generous donors, and community partners make this work possible. Together, they sustain our steadfast mission: providing high-quality, compassionate care to men with intellectual and developmental disabilities.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-making-home-happen_2 elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"making-home-happen_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/contact\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Schedule a campus visit \u2192<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Residential Living Well-maintained homes with around-the-clock compassionate care and support. Well-maintained homes with around-the-clock compassionate care and support. Divider Well-maintained homes with around-the-clock compassionate care and support. What We Offer We work alongside families, volunteers, and donors to make a meaningful difference in the daily lives of the men we serve. Learn More The Difference [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":0,"parent":317,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template"